  test('spec-6-4: bookmarkMessage() on a user bubble drives a genuine POST '
      'to entries-create through the real SaveChatMessageAsEntryUseCase -> '
      'EntriesRepositoryImpl -> ApiClient pipeline, flips that bubble to '
